[wallet-config] NEXT_PUBLIC_WALLET_CONNECT_PROJECT_ID is invalid (32 characters — expected a 36-character UUID like 123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000).
Mobile MetaMask connection (WalletConnect v2) will hang on 'Connecting to MetaMask...' until a real project ID is configured.
1) Create a free project at https://cloud.walletconnect.com (copy its Project ID).
2) Set NEXT_PUBLIC_WALLET_CONNECT_PROJECT_ID to that UUID in .env.local AND in your deployment (e.g. Vercel) environment variables.
Desktop MetaMask extension connection keeps working regardless.
 ⚠ Fast Refresh had to perform a full reload. Read more: https://nextjs.org/docs/messages/fast-refresh-reload
